{"ref":"BDB, צֹ֫חַר","hw":"צֹ֫חַר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צֹ֫חַר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  father of Ephron the Hittite <a data-ref=\"Genesis 23:8\" href=\"/Genesis.23.8\">Gn 23:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:9\" href=\"/Genesis.25.9\">25:9</a>, Σααρ.<br><strong>2.</strong>  son of Simeon <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:10\" href=\"/Genesis.46.10\">Gn 46:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:15\" href=\"/Exodus.6.15\">Ex 6:15</a>, Σααρ.<br><strong>3.</strong>  name in Judah <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.7\">1 Ch 4:7</a> Qr (<span dir=\"rtl\">וְצֹחַר</span>; Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">יצחר</span>), Σααρ, 𝔊L Εισαρ.","next":"BDB, יִצְחָר","prev":"BDB, צָחֹר"}